{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">肥媽在《在家宴客60道菜》中化繁為簡，示範做法簡單的「陳皮滷水獅頭鵝」！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"970c5664-68af-40a5-8b50-330fdc0c24d1.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026fkr34fOEAM1788513668.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"970c5664-68af-40a5-8b50-330fdc0c24d1.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳皮滷水獅頭鵝｜食材</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳皮滷水獅頭鵝｜做法</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">將陳皮用溫水泡軟後切絲。</p></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">將鵝肉盛起，待涼後斬件。</p></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"53590fc4-75cb-41a8-a79d-32119506a0e2.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026zy7aFAQd1R1788513668.webp\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"53590fc4-75cb-41a8-a79d-32119506a0e2.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">陳皮滷水獅頭鵝｜實用小貼士</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\">